        "reference": "Psalms 80:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Turn us again, O God of hosts, and cause thy face to shine; and we shall be saved.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast brought a vine out of Egypt: thou hast cast out the heathen, and planted it.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "TG Vineyard of the Lord."
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "Ex. 20:2; 1 Ne. 17:23 (23–25); Moses 1:26."
          },
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 57,
            "text": "Num. 21:3 (1–3); Acts 13:19 (17–19)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Vineyard of the Lord.",
            "prettyString": "TG Vineyard of the Lord",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Vineyard of the Lord",
                "entryId": "tg-vineyard-of-the-lord",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou preparedst room before it, and didst cause it to take deep root, and it filled the land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 20
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "The hills were covered with the shadow of it, and the boughs thereof were like the goodly cedars.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "Gen. 13:16 (14–16)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 78
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "She sent out her boughs unto the sea, and her branches unto the river.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Why hast thou then broken down her hedges, so that all they which pass by the way do pluck her?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 19,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "Rom. 11:20 (15–24)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 18
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "The boar out of the wood doth waste it, and the wild beast of the field doth devour it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:13",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Return, we beseech thee, O God of hosts: look down from heaven, and behold, and visit this vine;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:14",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And the vineyard which thy right hand hath planted, and the branch that thou madest strong for thyself.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 71
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:15",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "It is burned with fire, it is cut down: they perish at the rebuke of thy countenance.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 29
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:16",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "Let thy hand be upon the man of thy right hand, upon the son of man whom thou madest strong for thyself.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 72
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:17",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "So will not we go back from thee: quicken us, and we will call upon thy name.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "OR turn away."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 80:18",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 80,
        "verse": 18
      },
